@startuml
title PayLink - Refund a Failed Payment Sequence Diagram

autonumber

participant "Payment Processing" as Pay
participant "Biller Integration" as Adapter
participant "Accounts and Wallet" as Wallet
participant "Notifications" as Notif
participant "Reconciliation" as Recon
actor "Support Employee" as Support

note over Pay
  Payment is Failed: the biller refused, or a payment
  that was Unknown is confirmed as not received.
end note

alt Biller refuses (from SentToBiller)
    Adapter --> Pay: Refused
else Unknown resolved as not received
    Recon --> Pay: Biller has no record of this payment
    note right of Recon
      Unknown is never refunded
      until the biller is known
      not to have received it.
    end note
end

Pay -> Pay: Status = Failed
Pay -> Wallet: Release hold (held -> available)
Wallet -> Wallet: Create ledger entry (hold release)
Wallet --> Pay: Hold released
Pay -> Pay: Status = Refunded (final)
Pay -> Notif: Send SMS + push (failed, money returned)

opt Reconciliation difference needs review
    Recon -> Support: Flag difference in report
end

@enduml